rness gives worker threads only 2 MiB; libFuzzer/CI runs the target on the 8 MiB main thread. Pin `std::thread::Builder::new().stack_size(8<<20)` so a bounded-but-deep recursion test is faithful, not hostage to the 2 MiB default.\n- `/tmp` is noexec in the sandbox — build/run under the project worktree (or set CARGO_TARGET_DIR there), not `/tmp`.\n\nSee [[endo-local-test-bin-shims]] for the JS-side bin shims.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
